# HuggingFace access token — required for the gated LLaMA-3.2-3B model used by TRIBE v2.
# 1. Create a read token at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# 2. Accept the Llama-3.2 license at https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.2-3B
# 3. Copy this file to .env and paste your token:
HF_KEY=hf_your_token_here
